        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Other Receipts’ 101 Sale proceeds of confiscated goods minor heads below the duty Sub-Major heads. The sub- head 'Deduct-Refunds' will appear under the minor heads below the sub-major heads’04 Cesses on Commodities’ and ‘60, other Receipts’. Excise Duties which were in force up to 16.3.1972. in lieu thereof are awaited from Banks are to be booked under this minor head pending transfer to the minor head concerned on receipt of the said details from the Bank or from the departmental officer concerned. (i) Sale proceeds of confiscated Goods. (ii) Fees, Fines and penalties. transferred to the Central Road Fund. 30% of the Fund would be transferred to the State Governments for development and maintenance of State Roads. Deleted ‘plus-entry’ in the State accounts. country except Nepal and Bhutan will appear as distinct sub-head."
      }
    ]
