    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Other Taxes and Duties on Commodities and Services 101 Entertainment Tax (a) Tax Collections (b) Other Receipts (c) Deduct-Refunds The sub-head ‘Other Receipts’ will record miscellaneous receipts like penalties, fine etc. in the administration of the relevant Acts/Regulations. (a) Tax on travel by Air (b) Tax on travel by Sea (c) Deduct-Refunds other minor heads below this major head. Fees’, ‘Licence Fees’ and other Miscellaneous Receipts. ‘plus-entry’ in the State accounts. a) Equalisation Levy payable by taxpayer (deductor), b) Equalisation Levy payable as per demand raised by Income Tax Department, c) Miscellaneous Receipts, d) Penalties, Fine etc., e) Refund."
      }
    ]
