      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Loans for Crop Husbandry Improvement Act’ and ‘Agriculturist's Loan Act’. If they are related to the function 'Agriculture'. If however, such loans are for the purpose of ‘Minor Irrigation’, ‘Soil Conservation’ or ‘Area Development’ they will be accounted for under the relevant minor heads below the Major head ‘6402-Loans for soil and water conservation’. This minor head will also include transactions on account of loans for the development and cultivation of ceiling surplus land assigned to the landless."
      }
