      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "General sub-major heads appropriate to the nature of industry developed by the undertaking. The minor head for each departmental commercial undertaking may have the following standard sub heads with suitable detailed heads there under: - Management Machinery and Equipment Operation and Maintenance Suspense Renewals and Replacements Other expenditure Buildings and development of the categories of industries represented by them. Direction and Administration Research and Development Subsidies Assistance to cooperatives Other expenditure sub-heads. any minor head would henceforth be charged to this minor head. Scheme of Ministry of Chemicals and Fertilizers under ‘New Scheme of Petrochemicals’."
